Conceptual influence
--------------------
The design notes record ideas drawn from the following projects. This listing
records conceptual influence. No code, skill instructions, Guard components,
hooks, scripts, or runtime files from either project are vendored here.

Nature skills
Source: https://github.com/Yuan1z0825/nature-skills
Verified commit: 473e8d7b1b918fe37208d3a5e143a3ac9af4c91b
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0
Useful concepts: connect claims to evidence, assign argument functions to
prose, preserve statistical meaning, and organize main and supporting detail
by relevance.

Stop That Shit
Source: https://github.com/lennney/stop-that-shit
Public label: 0.2.5 (the repository does not provide a v0.2.5 tag)
Release page commit: 8bc1ac558167121e7f28d9fb0bec05c039952206
